Single block, 15 degree ramp.
Mach 7.0 Laminar Viscous Flow. Time-dependent.
run.E.dat: Finite-Rate Non-Equilibrium Air.

freestream static 7.0 14.7 520.0 0.0 0.0

turbulence laminar

downstream pressure extrapolate order one zone 1

dq limiter on

rhs roe second
tvd factor 1

cfl 0.5 

cycle 80
iterations per cycle 100 print frequency 10

converge order 9
test 128

chemistry
  file air-5sp-gen-30k.chm !Five species chem. file, valid to 30k Kelvin
  finite rate              !multi-species Finite-rate (F-R)
  mass fractions air       !Start with 21% O2, 79% N2, use with F-R or FZ
endchemistry

end
